Subject: [PATCH 3/7] local: document running the stack locally

Covers the compose commands, the healthcheck ordering, the x86_64 fallback
switch, why the Rust toolchain is pinned, and the fact that ./volumes holds
state by bind mount so `docker compose down -v` does not clear it.
